Description: Build against Linux Mint's cinnamon-desktop alone
 Muffin's test suite, which alone asks for cinnamon-settings-daemon, defines
 no tests, and on Ubuntu the daemon pulls in a cinnamon-desktop library that
 takes Linux Mint's one over. Ubuntu's own cinnamon-desktop is older than
 Mint's, which the version requirement rules out.
Author: machine-setup
Forwarded: not-needed
--- a/debian/control
+++ b/debian/control
@@ -11,7 +11,6 @@ Build-Depends:
         dbus <!nocheck>,
         dmz-cursor-theme <!nocheck>,
         gnome-pkg-tools (>= 0.10),
-        cinnamon-settings-daemon <!nocheck>,
         gobject-introspection (>= 1.41.3),
         gtk-doc-tools (>= 1.15),
         libcairo2-dev (>= 1.10.0),
@@ -22,7 +21,7 @@ Build-Depends:
         libgirepository1.0-dev (>= 0.9.12),
         libglib2.0-dev (>= 2.61.1),
         libglvnd-dev,
-        libcinnamon-desktop-dev,
+        libcinnamon-desktop-dev (>= 6.6),
         libgbm-dev (>= 17.3) [linux-any],
         libgdk-pixbuf-2.0-dev | libgdk-pixbuf2.0-dev,
         libgraphene-1.0-dev (>= 1.9.3),
